cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, data, or the accompanying paper, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Guardrail Survival under Single-Cycle Agentic Self-Summarization"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifact (manuscript, pipeline, and results) for a study of how a
  standing safety rule survives a single agentic self-summarization (compaction) cycle.
  The central finding is that a presence check is not a safety check: when compaction
  does not drop a rule outright, it often leaves a residue that looks like a rule but does
  not act like one.
